  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 11 new plugins and 90 official-repo stars, with npm weekly downloads at 351,690; growth is concentrated in desktop clients (dataelement/dsh-desktop +22, anywhere-labs/dsh-desktop +12). However, 12,732 of 16,062 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7 days and the health score sits at 36, so activity—not total count—is the metric to watch.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>11</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>90</b> 星，npm 周下载 <b>351690</b>；榜单增量集中在桌面端（dataelement/dsh-desktop +<b>22</b>、anywhere-labs/dsh-desktop +<b>12</b>）。不过 <b>16062</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>12732</b> 个已 7 天无更新，健康分仅 <b>36</b>，建议持续观察活跃度而非总量。"
